heading\":\"Smart Classrooms\",\"description\":\"<p><span class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">At Malviya Convent School, our Smart Classrooms are designed to transform traditional teaching into an engaging, interactive, and technology‑driven learning experience. Equipped with advanced digital teaching tools, interactive displays, projectors, and multimedia resources, these classrooms make lessons more dynamic,visual, and easy to understand.By integrating technology with the curriculum, teachers create immersive learning experiences that encourage active participation, critical thinking, and collaborative learning. Audio‑visual presentations, educational videos, animations, and digital content help simplify complex concepts, making learning more enjoyable and effective for students.Our Smart Classrooms foster creativity, curiosity, and innovation while preparingstudents with the digital skills required for the 21st century. They provide an inclusive and stimulating environment where every learner is inspired to achieve </span></p><p><span class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">academic excellence and develop a lifelong love for learning.At Malviya Convent School, our Smart Classrooms are designed to transform traditional teaching into an engaging, interactive, and technology‑driven learning experience. Equipped with advanced digital teaching tools, interactive displays, projectors, and multimedia resources, these classrooms make lessons more dynamic,visual, and easy to understand.By integrating technology with the curriculum, teachers create immersive learning experiences that encourage active participation, critical thinking, and collaborative learning. Audio‑visual presentations, educational videos, animations, and digital content help simplify complex concepts, making learning more enjoyable and effective for students.Our Smart Classrooms foster creativity, curiosity, and innovation while preparing students with the digital skills required for the 21st century. They provide an inclusive and stimulating environment where every learner is inspired to achieve academic excellence and develop a lifelong love for learning.</span></p>\",\"images\":[\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1783497268/school-saas/content/sevo1mmhfkec15ctlz9a.webp\",\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1783497269/school-saas/content/tuthantrms7ysbhifh7k.webp\"],\"headingColor\":\"#ffffff\",\"headingFont\":\"merriweather\"}]}', 1, '2026-07-08 01:49:56', '2026-08-02 04:17:34');
INSERT INTO `tbl_module_content` (`id`, `school_id`, `module_key`, `content`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (364, 9, 'faculty', '{\"members\":[{\"id\":\"m‑1783497940836\",\"photo\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1783666377/school-saas/content/ya63vflbwomwmdtvwh8w.jpg\",\"name\":\"Mr. Sunny Kapoor\",\"designation\":\"Accountancy\",\"qualification\":\"CA\",\"experience\":\"25 years\",\"bio\":\"<p><strong>Sunny Kapoor</strong> is a dedicated <strong>Senior Accountancy Teacher</strong> with a passion for helping students build a strong foundation in commerce and financial studies.</p><p>He is committed to making Accountancy an engaging and practical subject by connecting theoretical concepts with real‑world business applications. With his </p><p>expertise in the subject and a student‑centric teaching approach, Mr. Kapoor encourages analytical thinking, conceptual clarity, and problem‑solving skills. His interactive classroom sessions help students gain confidence in financial accounting, bookkeeping, and business principles while preparing them for academic excellence.</p>\",\"level\":\"pgt\",\"udiseCode\":\"TV50532\"},{\"id\":\"m‑1784625571953\",\"photo\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1784625618/school-saas/content/xlqlzwd3pmo3cq594rw2.jpg\",\"name\":\"Ambrish Rawat\",\"designation\":\"Science\",\"qualification\":\"M‑Tech\",\"experience\":\"20 Years\",\"level\":\"pgt\",\"udiseCode\":\"TV54853\"},{\"id\":\"m‑1783498072404\",\"photo\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1783666394/school-saas/content/mlmzkhww3yzkwawao02o.jpg\",\"name\":\"Mrs. Samay Malhotra\",\"designation\":\"English \",\"qualification\":\"M.Ed\",\"experience\":\"40 Years\",\"bio\":\"<p><strong>Sulekha Malhotra</strong> is a highly respected <strong>Senior English Teacher</strong> with an exceptional <strong>40 years of teaching experience</strong>. Throughout her distinguished </p><p>career, she has inspired generations of students with her deep knowledge of the English language and literature, while fostering a lifelong love for reading,</p><p>writing, and effective communication.Renowned for her dedication, patience, and student‑centric approach, Mrs. Malhotra creates an engaging classroom environment that encourages creativity, critical thinking, and confident self‑expression. Her extensive experience enables her to guide students in developing strong language skills, literary appreciation, and excellent academicperformance.</p>\",\"level\":\"prt\",\"udiseCode\":\"TV54522\"},{\"id\":\"m‑1783498590538\",\"photo\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1783666424/school-saas/content/ggjxl5rhza4tgakgli3t.jpg\",\"name\":\"Aadarsh Sharma\",\"designation\":\"English\",\"qualification\":\"MSc\",\"experience\":\"12 Years\",\"bio\":\"<p><strong>Aashi Sharma</strong> is a passionate <strong>Junior School English Teacher</strong> dedicated to building strong language and communication skills in young learners. She believes in creating a joyful, interactive, and nurturing classroom where children develop confidence in reading, writing, speaking, and listening.</p><p>Using engaging teaching methods such as storytelling, creative activities, phonics, and interactive discussions, Ms. Sharma makes learning English enjoyable and meaningful. She encourages curiosity, creativity, and self‑expression while helping students develop a strong foundation in grammar, vocabulary, and comprehension.</p>\",\"level\":\"pgt\",\"udiseCode\":\"TV54221\"},{\"id\":\"m‑1784616734797\",\"photo\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1784616750/school-saas/content/guwsxvnqcsokwge1po3q.jpg\",\"name\":\"Sunita Williams\",\"designation\":\"english\",\"qualification\":\"fddf\",\"experience\":\"32\",\"level\":\"tgt\",\"udiseCode\":\"TV56832\"},{\"id\":\"m‑1783498265643\",\"photo\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1783666411/school-saas/content/r3d9gumaj23d3f1ipj7c.jpg\",\"name\":\"Bharti Jain\",\"designation\":\"SST\",\"qualification\":\"BA\",\"experience\":\"15 Years\",\"bio\":\"<p><strong>Bharti Jain</strong> is a dedicated <strong>Social Science (SST) Teacher</strong> committed to makinglearning meaningful, engaging, and relevant for her students. With a passion </p><p>for history, geography, civics, and economics, she helps students develop a deeper understanding of society, culture, and the world around them.</p><p></p><p>Through interactive teaching methods and real‑life examples, Mrs. Jain encourages critical thinking, analytical skills, and active participation in the</p><p>classroom. She strives to create a positive learning environment where students are inspired to explore new ideas, appreciate diverse perspectives, and become </p><p>informed and responsible citizens.</p>\",\"level\":\"ntt\",\"udiseCode\":\"TV64333\"}],\"banners\":[\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1783499060/school-saas/content/ymctqolnynt41jou0xbz.jpg\"]}', 1, '2026-07-08 02:36:37', '2026-08-12 21:21:12');
