9:00 AM to 12:00 PM</strong><span class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">. Parents are requested to attend the meeting to discuss their child&#39;s academic progress, classroom performance, and overall development.A Parent‑Teacher Meeting (PTM) will be held on </span><strong class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">Saturday, 8th August 2026</strong><span class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">, from </span><strong class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">9:00 AM to 12:00 PM</strong><span class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">. Parents are requested to attend the meeting to discuss their child&#39;s academic progress, classroom performance, and overall development.A Parent‑Teacher Meeting (PTM) will be held on </span><strong class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">Saturday, 8th August 2026</strong><span class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">, from </span><strong class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">9:00 AM to 12:00 PM</strong><span class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">. Parents are requested to attend the meeting to discuss their child&#39;s academic progress, classroom performance, and overall development.</span></p>\",\"image\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1785232975/school-saas/content/mehunspiptmgcbfmxdyb.jpg\",\"pinned\":true,\"images\":[{\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1785826655/school-saas/content/jlzhohwjoniuui0b80sj.jpg\"}],\"time\":\"12:24\",\"tickerPriority\":\"1\"}]}', 1, '2026-07-28 03:59:26', '2026-09-15 07:01:24');
INSERT INTO `tbl_module_content` (`id`, `school_id`, `module_key`, `content`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (1110, 9, 'events', '{\"heading\":\"Events & Activities at MCS\",\"description\":\"<p>Stay updated with everything happening on campus — from cultural fests to sports days.</p>\",\"events\":[{\"id\":\"evt‑1785827472571\",\"title\":\"Annual Day\",\"date\":\"2026‑08‑04\",\"time\":\"12:41\",\"venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"tag\":\"Cultural\",\"body\":\"<p>Annual Day is one of the most anticipated celebrations in a school, bringing together students, teachers, parents, and guests to commemorate the achievements of the academic year. The event showcases the diverse talents of students through vibrant cultural performances, including dance, music, drama, and artistic presentations. It also serves as a platform to recognize excellence by honoring outstanding achievements in academics, sports, leadership, and extracurricular activities. More than just a celebration, Annual Day reflects the school&#39;s commitment to holistic education, fostering creativity, confidence, teamwork, and a strong sense of community among students.Annual Day is one of the most anticipated celebrations in a school, bringing together students, teachers, parents, and guests to commemorate the achievements of the academic year. The event showcases the diverse talents of students through vibrant cultural performances, including dance, music, drama, and artistic presentations. It also serves as a platform to recognize excellence by honoring outstanding achievements in academics, sports, leadership, and extracurricular activities. More than just a celebration, Annual Day reflects the school&#39;s commitment to holistic education, fostering creativity, confidence, teamwork, and a strong sense of community among students.</p>\",\"image\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1785827771/school-saas/content/kxpnlzxg3uzr9dcqthwj.jpg\",\"videos\":[{\"id\":\"vid‑1785827899104\",\"sourceType\":\"link\",\"videoUrl\":\"\",\"linkUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Klj010WMRlc\",\"title\":\"Annual Day 2\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1785827929/school-saas/content/sl120ig8aj48aivrvdq2.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"vid‑1785827820590\",\"sourceType\":\"link\",\"videoUrl\":\"\",\"linkUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Klj010WMRlc\",\"title\":\"Annual Day\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1785827897/school-saas/content/ciah8uxu9jjdfabs81pt.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"vid‑1785827900491\",\"sourceType\":\"link\",\"videoUrl\":\"\",\"linkUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Klj010WMRlc\",\"title\":\"Annual Day 3\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1785827952/school-saas/content/u3huoccixdeydw8gfzea.jpg\"}],\"highlights\":[]},{\"id\":\"evt‑1\",\"title\":\"Ted Talk \",\"date\":\"2026‑08‑04\",\"time\":\"08:00\",\"venue\":\"School Seminar\",\"tag\":\"Academic\",\"body\":\"<p><span class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">A </span><strong class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">TED Talk event in a school</strong><span class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\"> is an educational program where students, teachers, or guest speakers deliver short, inspiring talks on ideas, experiences, innovations, or social issues. Modeled after the TED format, each speaker usually presents for </span><strong class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">5–18 minutes</strong><span class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">, aiming to share meaningful ideas that educate, motivate, and encourage critical thinking. Topics can include science, technology, leadership, mental health, creativity, environmental awareness, and personal growth.</span></p><p><span class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">Organizing a TED‑style event in school helps students improve their public speaking, communication, confidence, and presentation skills. It also provides a platform for sharing unique perspectives and learning from others. Such events promote curiosity, creativity, and collaboration, making learning more engaging and inspiring for the entire school community.</span></p>\",\"image\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1785647864/school-saas/content/ttqww4yhzgeqscdfb9jq.jpg\",\"highlights\":[{\"id\":\"hl‑1785659017802\",\"heading\":\"Julian Treasure \",\"description\":\"<p><strong class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">Julian Treasure</strong><span class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\"> is a British author, speaker, and communication expert best known for his work on the power of listening and effective speaking. His TED Talks, including </span><em class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">How to Speak So That People Want to Listen</em><span class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\"> and </span><em class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">5 Ways to Listen Better</em><span class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">, have been viewed by millions worldwide. He believes that good communication is one of the most important skills for building relationships, succeeding at work, and making a positive impact.</span></p><p></p><p><span class=\\\"ql-font-playfair\\\">Julian Treasure teaches that speaking with clarity, empathy, and purpose can help people become more influential and confident. He encourages developing better listening habits by being fully present, avoiding distractions, and appreciating different perspectives. Through his books, workshops, and public talks, he inspires individuals to improve both their speaking and listening skills, leading to stronger personal and professional connections.</span></p>\",\"images\":[\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1785659568/school-saas/content/zihebukibydzwnofliwo.jpg\",\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1785659569/school-saas/content/xhzhpf5uoqkzw9piqswq.jpg\",\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1785659571/school-saas/content/cq164rwnfwcsuxpksjvg.jpg\",\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1785659572/school-saas/content/g4acmkaxfkbztruhcfx7.jpg\",\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1785659573/school-saas/content/soaawp7i3cejuhhm1phu.jpg\"],\"videos\":[{\"id\":\"vid‑1785659579645\",\"sourceType\":\"link\",\"videoUrl\":\"\",\"linkUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6GuyMZ-cSzE&t=922s\",\"title\":\" Think Fast, Talk Smart: Communication Techniques\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1785666482/school-saas/content/hk4f5avkmbf8xvi0fldk.jpg\"}]}],\"videos\":[{\"id\":\"vid‑1785659085839\",\"sourceType\":\"link\",\"videoUrl\":\"\",\"linkUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6GuyMZ-cSzE&t=922s\",\"title\":\" Think Fast, Talk Smart: Communication Techniques\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1785828436/school-saas/content/pxqte6xb4yiohpo7m5qs.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"vid‑1785659145453\",\"sourceType\":\"link\",\"videoUrl\":\"\",\"linkUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HAnw168huqA\",\"title\":\"How to Speak So That People Want to Listen | Julian Treasure | TED\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1785828440/school-saas/content/ozah0cpwvimbtutlhrs3.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"vid‑1785659233536\",\"sourceType\":\"link\",\"videoUrl\":\"\",\"linkUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vU4Ak3DBb1o\",\"title\":\"What Stanford students actually use ChatGPT for\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dllspz9pv/image/upload/v1785828446/school-saas/content/ussiaosrpuuyh3a1gwyb.jpg\"}]}]}', 1, '2026-07-29 06:54:42', '2026-09-15 07:04:15');
